"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_ARC_TRANSFORM_UNPROXYABLE_CLASSES+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr "[lock] `link:#quarkus-arc_quarkus.arc.transform-unproxyable-classes[quarkus.arc.transform-unproxyable-classes]`"

